ref=\"/images/hranice-soukromi-obr-38.jpg\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"> <img src=\"/images/hranice-soukromi-obr-38.jpg\" alt=\"\"> </a>   </div><div class=\"media-row__item\"> <a href=\"/images/hranice-soukromi-obr-39.jpg\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"> <img src=\"/images/hranice-soukromi-obr-39.jpg\" alt=\"\"> </a>   </div><div class=\"media-row__item\"> <a href=\"/images/hranice-soukromi-obr-40.jpg\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"> <img src=\"/images/hranice-soukromi-obr-40.jpg\" alt=\"\"> </a>   </div><div class=\"media-row__item\"> <a href=\"/images/hranice-soukromi-obr-41.jpg\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"> <img src=\"/images/hranice-soukromi-obr-41.jpg\" alt=\"\"> </a>   </div> </div>\n<div class=\"media-row \"> <div class=\"media-row__item\"> <a href=\"/images/hranice-soukromi-obr-42.jpg\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"> <img src=\"/images/hranice-soukromi-obr-42.jpg\" alt=\"\"> </a>   </div><div class=\"media-row__item\"> <a href=\"/images/hranice-soukromi-obr-43.jpg\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"> <img src=\"/images/hranice-soukromi-obr-43.jpg\" alt=\"\"> </a>   </div><div class=\"media-row__item\"> <a href=\"/images/hranice-soukromi-obr-44.jpg\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"> <img src=\"/images/hranice-soukromi-obr-44.jpg\" alt=\"\"> </a>   </div><div class=\"media-row__item\"> <a href=\"\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"> <img src=\"\" alt=\"\"> </a>   </div><div class=\"media-row__item\"> <a href=\"\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"> <img src=\"\" alt=\"\"> </a>   </div><div class=\"media-row__item\"> <a href=\"\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"> <img src=\"\" alt=\"\"> </a>   </div> </div>\n<p><strong>série 10:</strong></p>\n<div class=\"media-row \"> <div class=\"media-row__item\"> <a href=\"/images/hranice-soukromi-obr-45.jpg\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"> <img src=\"/images/hranice-soukromi-obr-45.jpg\" alt=\"\"> </a>   </div><div class=\"media-row__item\"> <a href=\"\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"> <img src=\"\" alt=\"\"> </a>   </div><div class=\"media-row__item\"> <a href=\"\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"> <img src=\"\" alt=\"\"> </a>   </div><div class=\"media-row__item\"> <a href=\"\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"> <img src=\"\" alt=\"\"> </a>   </div><div class=\"media-row__item\"> <a href=\"\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"> <img src=\"\" alt=\"\"> </a>   </div><div class=\"media-row__item\"> <a href=\"\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"> <img src=\"\" alt=\"\"> </a>   </div> </div>\n<p><strong>Zdrojový kód</strong><br>\nZdrojový Python kód pro tento projekt je dostupný zde:</p>\n<span data-i18n-protected=\"p0\" translate=\"no\" class=\"notranslate\"></span> </div> ",
  "translatedFragment": " <div class=\"post-header\">  <h1 class=\"post-title\">The Boundaries of Privacy</h1> <p class=\"post-meta\"> February 2024 </p> </div> <div class=\"post-body\"> <p>I created a simple program that can be given one or more directories. It searches through all of them, including their subdirectories, and when it finds an image (by “image” I mean a file with the extension .jpg, .jpeg, .png, .tif, or .tiff), it adds its path to the set of all images. Once the scan is complete, it selects only one image from them and displays it.</p>\n<p>I then connected all the hard drives containing backups of the photos I’ve collected over the years to my computer (they now contain over 91,000 photos). I then set all the hard drives as the default directories from which the program selects images. For practical reasons, it was necessary to exclude certain directories from the selection, as some contained only program data, such as program icons. When I pressed the ENTER key, the program selected a random photograph from my life. When I pressed ENTER again, the program selected another photograph, and so on…</p>\n<p>From the randomly selected images, I created several series that built on one another. Each series begins with a random image selection and continues selecting images at random until it encounters one I don’t want to publish. This last image in the series is presented out of focus. I was curious to see which photos would cause a series to end and why. To my surprise, in most cases, it was concern for other people’s privacy that brought the series to a close. In other cases, it was photos of work documents, other people’s homes, and my own home, etc.</p>\n<p>Through this project, I discovered just how blurred the boundaries of my privacy are—if there are any at all. At a certain point, however, I had to decide whether or not to publish a photograph. This choice, however, was usually quite complex and ambiguous.</p>\n<p><strong>Series 1:</strong></p>\n<div class=\"media-row \"> <div class=\"media-row__item\"> <a href=\"/images/hranice-soukromi-obr-1.jpg\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"> <img src=\"/images/hranice-soukromi-obr-1.jpg\" alt=\"\"> </a>   </div><div class=\"media-row__item\"> <a href=\"\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"> <img src=\"\" alt=\"\"> </a>   </div><div class=\"media-row__item\"> <a href=\"\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"> <img src=\"\" alt=\"\"> </a>   </div><div class=\"media-row__item\"> <a href=\"\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"> <img src=\"\" alt=\"\"> </a>   </div><div class=\"media-row__item\"> <a href=\"\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"> <img src=\"\" alt=\"\"> </a>   </div><div class=\"media-row__item\"> <a href=\"\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"> <img src=\"\" alt=\"\"> </a>   </div> </div>\n<p><strong>Series 2:</strong></p>\n<div class=\"media-row \"> <div class=\"media-row__item\"> <a href=\"/images/hranice-soukromi-obr-2.jpg\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"> <img src=\"/images/hranice-soukromi-obr-2.jpg\" alt=\"\"> </a>   </div><div class=\"media-row__item\"> <a href=\"/images/hranice-soukromi-obr-3.jpg\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"> <img src=\"/images/hranice-soukromi-obr-3.jpg\" alt=\"\"> </a>   </div><div class=\"media-row__item\"> <a href=\"/images/hranice-soukromi-obr-4.jpg\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"> <img src=\"/images/hranice-soukromi-obr-4.jpg\" alt=\"\"> </a>   </div><div class=\"media-row__item\"> <a href=\"/images/hranice-soukromi-obr-5.jpg\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"> <img src=\"/images/hranice-soukromi-obr-5.jpg\" alt=\"\"> </a>   </div><div class=\"media-row__item\"> <a href=\"/images/hranice-soukromi-obr-6.jpg\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"> <img src=\"/images/hranice-soukromi-obr-6.jpg\" alt=\"\"> </a>   </div><div class=\"media-row__item\"> <a href=\"/images/hranice-soukromi-obr-7.jpg\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"> <img src=\"/images/hranice-soukromi-obr-7.jpg\" alt=\"\"> </a>   </div> </div>\n<div class=\"media-row \"> <div class=\"media-row__item\"> <a href=\"/images/hranice-soukromi-obr-8.jpg\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"> <img src=\"/images/hranice-soukromi-obr-8.jpg\" alt=\"\"> </a>   </div><div class=\"media-row__item\"> <a href=\"/images/hranice-soukromi-obr-9.jpg\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"> <img src=\"/images/hranice-soukromi-obr-9.jpg\" alt=\"\"> </a>   </div><div class=\"media-row__item\"> <a href=\"\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"> <img src=\"\" alt=\"\"> </a>   </div><div class=\"media-row__item\"> <a href=\"\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"> <img src=\"\" alt=\"\"> </a>   </div><div class=\"media-row__item\"> <a href=\"\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"> <img src=\"\" alt=\"\"> </a>   </div><div class=\"media-row__item\"> <a href=\"\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"> <img src=\"\" alt=\"\"> </a>   </div> </div>\n<p><strong>Series 3:</strong></p>\n<div class=\"media-row \"> <div class=\"media-row__item\"> <a href=\"/images/hranice-soukromi-obr-10.jpg\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"> <img src=\"/images/hranice-soukromi-obr-10.jpg\" alt=\"\"> </a>   </div><div class=\"media-row__item\"> <a href=\"/images/hranice-soukromi-obr-11.jpg\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"> <img src=\"/images/hranice-soukromi-obr-11.jpg\" alt=\"\"> </a>   </div><div class=\"media-row__item\"> <a href=\"/images/hranice-soukromi-obr-12.jpg\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"> <img src=\"/images/hranice-soukromi-obr-12.jpg\" alt=\"\"> </a>   </div><div class=\"media-row__item\"> <a href=\"/images/hranice-soukromi-obr-13.jpg\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"> <img src=\"/images/hranice-soukromi-obr-13.jpg\" alt=\"\"> </a>   </div><div class=\"media-row__item\"> <a href=\"/images/hranice-soukro